  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHILDREN AND YOUTH CLIMATE RESILIENCE IN ZAMBIA&#x2019;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will strengthen girls, boys and youth&#x2019;s capacity and engagement with climate change players in Zambia through knowledge building, climate education, mobilization and networking.  Specifically - it will influence and support the government (central and local) in strengthening and implementing child sensitive disaster preparedness and management as well as improving DRR in schools with a participatory approach. It will shape girls, boys and youth&#x2019;s political and scientific understanding and advocate about the need for transformation in the climate change sector.  And it will improve the capacity of MGEE to coordinate climate change interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
